alse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mustela","id":325222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/325222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela","html_url":"https://github.com/mustela","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-06T13:16:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T10:16:57Z","closed_at":"2026-05-08T10:16:56Z","assignee":{"login":"mustela","id":325222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/325222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela","html_url":"https://github.com/mustela","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustela/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\n\nA user who has been removed from the **Identies Admin** role is still able to access users via the Identies API. This is a permissions/authorization bug — role removal should immediately revoke access to protected resources.\n\n## Affected User\n\n- **Profile:** https://custos.mylinden.family/users/d26b4dfd-ef09-4c17-8b66-efe103775ebd/overview\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Assign a user to the Identies Admin role\n2. Remove the user from the Identies Admin role\n3. Attempt to access users via the Identies API with that user's credentials\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nAfter being removed from the Identies Admin role, the user should receive a `403 Forbidden` (or equivalent) response when attempting to access the Identies API user endpoints.\n\n## Actual Behavior\n\nThe user retains access to the Identies API and can still retrieve user data despite no longer having the Identies Admin role.\n\n## Possible Causes\n\n- Role changes may not be invalidating existing sessions or tokens\n- Authorization checks may be cached and not reflecting the latest role state\n- The permission check on the API may not be correctly verifying current role membership at request time\n\n## Impact\n\n**High** — This is a security issue. Removed users should not retain access to privileged API endpoints.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserahq/custos/issues/96/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserahq/custos/issues/96/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"comple